but it also went out of the court...

03:35.230 --> 03:37.520
<b>O points</b>

03:38.900 --> 03:42.820
I'm really bad at controlling the power
behind my balls.

03:46.280 --> 03:47.580
That's good!

03:47.580 --> 03:48.910
But quite weak...

03:48.910 --> 03:51.540
