03:51.790 --> 03:54.790
Please teach me how to control my energy.

03:54.790 --> 03:57.380
Eh? I-It's nothing like that.

03:57.630 --> 04:00.380
You see, I was using all my strength the whole time.

04:00.920 --> 04:02.260
All your strength?

04:05.930 --> 04:07.470
