05:18.750 --> 05:21.170
<i>It's already this late.</i>

05:22.250 --> 05:27.170
<i>We forgot about the time because we were so absorbed in training.</i>

05:30.050 --> 05:31.470
That was fun!

05:32.050 --> 05:35.720
It feels like we really improved today.

05:35.720 --> 05:37.640
We make a lot less errors now.

05:37.640 --> 05:39.310
Although the ball still flies out...

05:39.310 --> 05:42.270
What? We still got time.

05:46.240 --> 05:48.030
Hey, Sawanatsu-san.

05:48.030 --> 05:48.700
Huh?

05:50.280 --> 05:53.530
I want to pair up with you, Sawanatsu-san.

05:56.450 --> 06:00.830
Harukaze, didn't you hear what I said yesterday?

06:00.830 --> 06:03.130
I don't want to be in a pair.

06:03.130 --> 06:04.210
No way!

06:03.840 --> 06:04.220
<b>No way?</b>

06:04.500 --> 06:10.050
This was my first time to be so absorbed in something that I forgot how late it is.

06:11.510 --> 06:15.720
I'm really happy, and my heart is beating so fast.

06:16.220 --> 06:19.190
It must be because I was with you!

06:21.690 --> 06:25.110
Th-That's all just in your mind!

06:27.860 --> 06:31.990
Besides... a no is a no!

06:34.580 --> 06:38.750
She won't change her mind so easily?

06:39.830 --> 06:42.460
Then again, I'm the same!

06:45.090 --> 06:46.800
Will she be okay?

06:46.800 --> 06:49.130
Doesn't look like she has any wounds.

06:49.130 --> 06:51.760
They're saying it's a psychological problem.

06:52.260 --> 06:55.550
Keeping motivated plays an important role in maintaining your shape.{(`w´)}

06:55.550 --> 06:57.930
