10:01.410 --> 10:02.830
It's simple.

10:03.490 --> 10:08.120
Your play is full of gambles.

10:08.910 --> 10:11.750
You're just mindlessly chasing the ball.

10:11.750 --> 10:13.540
You'll hit it now and then...

10:13.540 --> 10:16.130
