10:35.360 --> 10:37.070
<i>Sawanatsu-san...</i>

10:47.800 --> 10:50.080
Please take care of her then.

10:50.800 --> 10:54.340
We will. Sorry to be so pushy, though.

10:55.010 --> 10:57.140
My daughter is really lucky.{implied: to have friends like you.}

11:00.810 --> 11:03.480
Well, I'm going to leave now.

11:08.610 --> 11:11.360
She went home.

11:11.360 --> 11:12.530
Okay.

11:13.200 --> 11:16.030
Are you still planning to stay over?

11:16.030 --> 11:19.080
It feels like she could wake up any moment now.

11:20.620 --> 11:23.790
If she won't make it in time
for the next tournament,

11:23.790 --> 11:25.920
you'll pair up with Eli.

11:27.040 --> 11:29.090
I <i>am</i> the club president.

11:29.090 --> 11:31.840
I have to plan for the worst case scenario.

11:34.340 --> 11:35.390
Sorry...

11:35.390 --> 11:36.340
Kotone-chan!

11:37.050 --> 11:38.720
I can't do it.

11:38.720 --> 11:41.100
I can only play in a pair with...

11:42.770 --> 11:43.980
her.

12:00.450 --> 12:01.910
<i>Mishi.</i>

12:03.620 --> 12:08.880
I won't make it to Wimbledon if I don't train more!

12:11.210 --> 12:13.800
You're really desperate, aren't you?

12:16.510 --> 12:19.720
You know her weak spot, don't you?

12:20.930 --> 12:21.770
Well...

12:21.770 --> 12:25.690
Then you also know what you have to do.

12:25.690 --> 12:26.600
But...

12:26.600 --> 12:29.980
He told you nothing, huh?

12:29.980 --> 12:33.360
Listen, pairing up isn't about friendship or love.

12:33.360 --> 12:35.280
It's also not a master-servant relationship.

12:35.450 --> 12:37.030
It's about being equals.

12:37.570 --> 12:40.030
A master-servant relationship...

12:41.370 --> 12:43.660
Call me queen.

12:44.790 --> 12:46.460
Are you listening?

12:48.210 --> 12:51.330
We three will have another match tomorrow.

12:51.330 --> 12:53.000
Tell Sawanatsu for me.

12:53.000 --> 12:54.960
Yes!

12:57.300 --> 13:00.890
The rules will be the same as last time.

13:00.890 --> 13:01.720
I object!

13:01.720 --> 13:06.020
What? We're only playing because
you wanted revenge.

13:06.020 --> 13:10.230
Yeah, sure, but why're we playing doubles?

13:10.230 --> 13:13.190
You said it was a one-time-only deal.

13:13.190 --> 13:15.730
You want to play singles against me?

13:15.730 --> 13:22.110
That'd be like me playing against someone using a baseball bat instead of a racket.

13:22.110 --> 13:23.830
Doubles is fine.

13:23.830 --> 13:24.870
Harukaze, you're okay with this?

13:29.660 --> 13:30.790
Play ball!

13:39.300 --> 13:41.430
Dammit! I'll get it next time!

13:43.760 --> 13:45.600
Still the same?

13:50.020 --> 13:51.020
Out.

14:21.840 --> 14:23.430
Sorry.

14:23.430 --> 14:25.430
My bad.

14:28.390 --> 14:29.760
Sawanatsu-san!

14:29.970 --> 14:32.640
Are you all right, Sawanatsu-san?

14:32.640 --> 14:35.150
It's okay. I'm fine.

14:36.060 --> 14:37.860
I like your drive,

14:38.230 --> 14:40.740
but there's no point in continuing.

14:41.200 --> 14:42.700
Wanna run?

14:42.700 --> 14:47.200
It'd be great if you could return my balls with your tough talk.

14:48.410 --> 14:53.630
All the balls you hit out,
Harukaze could've easily taken.

14:53.630 --> 14:57.170
You're only causing trouble and are unable to return even a single ball.

14:57.630 --> 15:01.510
Sawanatsu, you got no talent at all.

15:02.550 --> 15:04.720
Well, that's it.

15:04.720 --> 15:09.970
From tomorrow on, you'll start from the basics to train as single players.

15:12.190 --> 15:16.230
Well, teaching someone who couldn't even score a single point

15:16.610 --> 15:19.280
in doubles might be a waste of time.

15:19.530 --> 15:23.280
<i>Shiki-senpai, you're really going
a bit too far with this.</i>

15:23.610 --> 15:29.700
Oh, Sawanatsu, I still like your determination,

15:29.700 --> 15:32.540
so I won't let you quit the club.

15:32.540 --> 15:33.670
But...

15:33.670 --> 15:37.090
I won't let trash take part in tournaments.

15:37.090 --> 15:38.960
You'll make a fine bench warmer.

15:48.760 --> 15:50.810
Please wait!

15:51.640 --> 15:52.930
What is it?

15:53.100 --> 15:55.650
Please, let's play a little while longer!

15:56.150 --> 15:58.770
You're full of energy, Harukaze!

15:58.770 --> 16:01.780
Sawanatsu's already at her limit, though.

16:01.780 --> 16:04.610
You want to play singles with me?

16:04.610 --> 16:05.660
You can play some long matches—

16:05.660 --> 16:07.780
No, just doubles, like before. Please.

16:09.830 --> 16:12.450
We still haven't beaten you yet.

16:17.000 --> 16:18.130
Fine.

16:21.880 --> 16:23.130
Harukaze.

16:23.130 --> 16:25.420
We'll win, Sawanatsu-san.

16:25.680 --> 16:29.420
Win? But she's really strong!

16:29.420 --> 16:33.930
True. But if I'm with you, I'm sure we can do it!

16:33.930 --> 16:35.350
Even though I got no talent.

16:35.350 --> 16:37.400
Sawanatsu-san, aren't you angry?

16:37.400 --> 16:39.810
You're not furious after hearing all that?!

16:45.070 --> 16:49.990
I'm mad! How can I not be?!

16:50.370 --> 16:53.500
Well, let's win together.

16:55.710 --> 17:00.380
If you can't do it alone,
we'll put up a fight together.

17:17.140 --> 17:18.900
<i>I really...</i>

17:18.900 --> 17:20.610
Don't give up!

17:22.320 --> 17:24.360
It's not over after you miss!

17:24.360 --> 17:25.690
I'm still here!

17:25.690 --> 17:27.530
I'll support you with all I got!{I'll never gonna let you down!}

17:27.900 --> 17:29.200
Harukaze...

17:29.200 --> 17:32.280
So, Sawanatsu-san, don't worry about the balls behind you.{surprise buttsecks!}

17:32.280 --> 17:34.580
Just focus on what's in front of you!

17:34.580 --> 17:36.620
It doesn't matter how many times you miss!

17:36.620 --> 17:39.500
If we work together, we'll be able to do it!

17:47.550 --> 17:49.800
<i>Looks like she got it.</i>

17:51.090 --> 17:52.800
<i>That's right, Sawanatsu.</i>

17:53.050 --> 17:56.310
<i>Although you're strong and got explosive power,</i>

17:56.310 --> 18:00.520
<i>you don't pay enough attention to your surroundings.</i>

18:00.520 --> 18:04.650
<i>And that means you got no talent for tennis.</i>

18:04.650 --> 18:08.190
<i>But that's only true for you.</i>

18:08.190 --> 18:11.160
<i>As long as your partner supports you</i>

18:11.160 --> 18:13.910
<i>there's no limit to what you can do!</i>

18:14.120 --> 18:15.330
Harukaze!

18:16.580 --> 18:19.750
You said it won't matter how many
times we fail, right?

18:19.750 --> 18:21.620
Yeah, that's what I said.

18:21.620 --> 18:25.710
Then, what'll we do if I miss a hundred times?

18:25.710 --> 18:29.420
I'll back you up a hundred times, of course!

18:29.420 --> 18:31.550
All right! Well said.

18:31.550 --> 18:34.050
Let's play as hard as we want!

18:34.050 --> 18:36.760
Fine with me!

18:39.890 --> 18:42.230
<i>How interesting.</i>

18:42.230 --> 18:44.650
<i>A wild beast playing only with instincts,</i>

18:44.650 --> 18:47.820
<i>and a high-achiever backing it up.</i>

18:47.820 --> 18:51.780
<i>They won't have to worry about efficiency that way.</i>

18:51.780 --> 18:55.410
<i>They really fit well together, though.</i>

18:55.410 --> 18:58.540
<i>There's no better than those two.</i>

19:08.420 --> 19:12.220
Dammit! We couldn't score even once!

19:12.220 --> 19:16.180
Yeah, but it was pretty fun.

19:17.390 --> 19:19.060
Hey, Sawanatsu-san.

19:19.060 --> 19:20.430
Huh?

19:20.430 --> 19:23.190
Um...

19:23.190 --> 19:25.690
Oh, about pairing up?

19:25.690 --> 19:27.320
Y-Yeah.

19:29.480 --> 19:32.070
Sure, I'll do it.

19:32.740 --> 19:33.740
Really?

19:33.740 --> 19:37.070
Beats being harassed by you for the next three years.

19:37.070 --> 19:38.330
Sawanatsu-san!

19:38.330 --> 19:39.580
However!

19:42.160 --> 19:44.620
We have to walk our path together.

19:44.620 --> 19:47.540
I'll get lost if we don't.

19:47.880 --> 19:49.920
I made up my mind.

19:49.920 --> 19:55.300
No matter what, you'll be the only one I'll allow to have my back.

19:55.300 --> 19:57.350
We'll stand or fall together.

19:58.220 --> 20:00.100
I'll be counting on you, partner.

20:02.270 --> 20:06.150
Right, Kotone-chan.

20:06.150 --> 20:11.480
Kotone-chan will walk forward together with me.

20:11.480 --> 20:13.360
That'll be fine.

20:13.700 --> 20:15.240
That'll be...

20:18.410 --> 20:20.910
Huh? Where am I?

20:21.580 --> 20:22.910
Asuna!

20:22.910 --> 20:25.790
Kotone-chan, Chitose-san?

20:25.790 --> 20:27.920
You got your memories back?

20:27.920 --> 20:29.540
Idiot!

20:29.540 --> 20:32.380
I'll tell the doctors and her mom!

20:32.630 --> 20:37.430
S-Stop! Kotone-chan, you're killing me!

20:43.140 --> 20:47.430
You weren't in your room,
so this is where you went.

20:47.850 --> 20:50.230
What're you doing here?

20:50.230 --> 20:51.980
Ah, I'm looking at the stars.

20:51.980 --> 20:55.360
Stars? Asuna, you're so laid back, huh?

20:55.360 --> 21:01.450
All of this happened because you zoned out during practice in the first place.

21:01.450 --> 21:03.660
No matter when, you have to—

21:03.660 --> 21:06.120
We have to walk forward with all our strength.

21:07.330 --> 21:09.710
Right, Kotone-chan?

21:10.630 --> 21:13.380
Yeah... It's fine if you got that.

21:13.380 --> 21:16.510
No matter what, I'll follow you!

21:16.510 --> 21:18.300
We'll go everywhere together!

21:20.090 --> 21:21.350
What're you saying?!

21:21.350 --> 21:23.510
Did you turn into an idiot all of a sudden?

21:24.100 --> 21:26.350
Kotone-chan is acting all cute!

21:26.350 --> 21:28.250
I'm not acting cute at all!

21:41.440 --> 21:46.740
<b><i>I extended my arms up high</i></b>

21:41.440 --> 21:46.740
takaku takaku ude wo nobashita

21:41.440 --> 21:46.740
高く高く腕を伸ばした

21:46.820 --> 21:52.200
<b><i>Knowing that they wouldn't reach</i></b>

21:46.820 --> 21:52.200
todokanai koto kurai wakatteru kedo

21:46.820 --> 21:52.200
届かないことくらいわかってるけど

21:52.330 --> 21:57.540
<b><i>I might be a crybaby</i></b>

21:52.330 --> 21:57.540
nakimushi dakedo sonna jibun mo

21:52.330 --> 21:57.540
泣き虫だけどそんな自分も

21:57.710 --> 22:03.090
<b><i>But I just can't hate myself, so I'm still here</i></b>

21:57.710 --> 22:03.090
kirai ni wa narenakute mada koko ni iru

21:57.710 --> 22:03.090
キライにはなれなくてまだココに居る

22:03.920 --> 22:09.090
<b><i>I dream about a tomorrow that I see far away</i></b>

22:03.920 --> 22:09.090
aa kogareta ashita wa mada tooku de

22:03.920 --> 22:09.090
ああ　焦がれた明日はまだ遠くで

22:09.300 --> 22:13.850
<b><i>It's smiling, beckoning</i></b>

22:09.300 --> 22:13.850
waratte iru temaneki shinagara

22:09.300 --> 22:13.850
笑っている　手招きしながら

22:14.140 --> 22:20.020
<b><i>Count 1 2 3 and raise up your heels</i></b>

22:14.140 --> 22:20.020
ichi ni san kazoe kakato wo agete miru

22:14.140 --> 22:20.020
123　数えかかとを上げてみる

22:20.310 --> 22:24.900
<b><i>Do it a little more, then just a little more</i></b>

22:20.310 --> 22:24.900
mou sukoshi sou ato sukoshi kurikaeshite wa

22:20.310 --> 22:24.900
もう少し　そうあと少し　繰り返しては

22:25.110 --> 22:30.200
<b><i>If I take a breath as deep as I can</i></b>

22:25.110 --> 22:30.200
dekiru dake ookiku iki wo shite

22:25.110 --> 22:30.200
出来るだけ大きく息をして

22:30.360 --> 22:35.240
<b><i>And imagine myself flying in the skies</i></b>

22:30.360 --> 22:35.240
sora wo tobu imeeji wo sureba

22:30.360 --> 22:35.240
空を飛ぶイメージをすれば

22:35.830 --> 22:40.540
<b><i>Then I can go anywhere!</i></b>

22:35.830 --> 22:40.540
doko e datte ikeru yo hora ne

22:35.830 --> 22:40.540
どこへだって行けるよほらね

22:41.750 --> 22:48.340
<b><i>I'm still dreaming of that one day when I might be able to fly</i></b>

22:41.750 --> 22:48.340
itsuka toberu kana nante yume minagara

22:41.750 --> 22:48.340
いつか飛べるかな　なんて夢見ながら

22:59.440 --> 23:02.070
Anyway, does this still work?

23:02.230 --> 23:02.900
Oh

23:03.780 --> 23:05.240
Kotone-chan!

23:05.240 --> 23:06.910
Asuna-chan!

23:06.910 --> 23:08.450
Chitose!

23:08.450 --> 23:09.950
Eli-chan!

23:10.580 --> 23:13.000
What the hell?!

23:13.540 --> 23:16.620
Sorry, I screwed up.

23:16.620 --> 23:18.870
<b>An average day's peace shattered by a blood covered girl.{A normal day shattered by a blood covered girl.}</b>

23:16.620 --> 23:17.750
<b>(m 60 370 l 58 418 1207 425 1207 365)</b>

23:19.260 --> 23:23.000
I see. I'm next then?

23:23.000 --> 23:24.880
<b>A demon's claw silently closing around them.</b>

23:23.000 --> 23:24.170
(m 60 370 l 58 418 1207 425 1207 365)

23:25.200 --> 23:29.260
Are you saying this was just the beginning?

23:29.260 --> 23:30.880
<b>Numerous days defying all logic...</b>

23:29.260 --> 23:30.170
<b>(m 60 370 l 58 418 1207 425 1207 365)</b>

23:34.300 --> 23:36.180
<b>and a seventh member who should've never existed—</b>

23:34.300 --> 23:35.510
<b>(m 60 370 l 58 418 1207 425 1207 365)</b>

23:36.560 --> 23:39.930
So that's what it was, Kotone. The message you wanted to pass on was—

23:39.930 --> 23:42.020
<b>The final truth waiting beyond madness and sacrifice.</b>

23:39.930 --> 23:41.310
<b>(m 60 370 l 58 418 1207 425 1207 365)</b>

23:42.600 --> 23:44.690
This joke isn't even funny, you know?

23:44.690 --> 23:46.730
<b>And thus the darkness spread all over Hokkaido.</b>

23:44.690 --> 23:46.730
<b>(m 60 370 l 58 418 1207 425 1207 365)</b>

23:48.670 --> 23:50.450
Jesus Christ!

23:50.450 --> 23:52.950
<b>With God descending in front of the girl, a legend becomes truth.</b>

23:50.450 --> 23:52.200
<b>(m 60 370 l 58 418 1207 425 1207 365)</b>

23:54.090 --> 23:57.740
I must break these chains of despair!

23:57.740 --> 23:59.580
<b>In the Summer of 20XX, coming to a cinema near you—</b>

23:57.740 --> 23:58.790
<b>(m 60 370 l 58 418 1207 425 1207 365)</b>

24:00.760 --> 24:03.500
Welcome to the promised land!

24:03.500 --> 24:06.840
<b>The crimson festival of blood is now...</b>

24:03.500 --> 24:04.670
<b>(m 60 370 l 58 418 1207 425 1207 365)</b>

24:05.500 --> 24:06.840
<b><i>not</i> starting!</b>

24:05.500 --> 24:06.080
<b>(m 60 370 l 58 418 1207 425 1207 365)</b>

24:06.990 --> 24:08.320
Hey!

24:08.320 --> 24:10.260
The end!
